	CLL		/YES-CLEAR LINK AND ADD MULTIPLICAND
	TAD	ACLO	/TO PARTIAL PRODUCT
	RAR		/SHIFT PARTIAL PRODUCT-THIS IS HI ORDER
	DCA	AC2	/RESULT-STORE BACK
