	RAR		/AND A BIT OR RESLT. INTO IT (LO ORD. PROD.)
	ISZ	FFMPY	/DONE ALL BITS?
	JMP	MP12L	/NO-LOOP BACK
	CLL CMA IAC	/YES-LOW ORDER PROD. OF QUOT. X OPL IN AC
	DCA	ACLO	/NEGATE AND STORE
	CML	RAL	/PROPAGATE CARRY
	JMP I	FD1P	/GO ON
